      "writtenOn": "2020-12-23T07:34:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d like to formally decide what values can be RECOVERY_SNAPSHOT_VERSION. What I\u0027m thinking is:\n\n1) a value indicating that recovery snapshot isn\u0027t used and can be captured (\"current\" or \"\" (empty))\n2) a numeric value indicating that the specified version of recovery snapshot will be used\n\nIf we allow both \"current\" and empty, what\u0027s the difference between them?",
      "parentUuid": "d8381587_15cf4c29",
